Head-and-shoulders portrait of a scavenger broker with layered hood, improvised respirator filters, and cable-fiber charms. Slight smirk, sharp eyes; soot and rain speckle on fabric. Background: ruined perimeter fence blur and low fog, minimal clutter. High-contrast silhouettes; controlled glow. Exactly ONE toxic accent: sickly green pulse from a tiny cable-junction badge. No readable text, no logos. 1:1 square.